  "label": "Textual mnemonic mapped onto visual absurdity",
  "description": "The text 'how to remember kid in hot car keep 2nd road beer with them!' is mapped onto the visual juxtaposition of a dignitary receiving flowers and a kangaroo drinking beer. The text attempts to create a mnemonic by associating the serious issue of child safety with an absurd, unrelated image (kangaroo drinking beer), implying that remembering 'beer with them' (a crude, nonsensical phrase) is the key to remembering 'kid in hot car'. The visual material provides the absurd context for this illogical mnemonic.",
